sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Client User
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Auth as Auth & Ownership Guard
    participant Emb as FastEmbed / SentenceTransformer
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL (pgvector)
    participant LLM as Groq Cloud API (Llama 3.3)

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/chat/query { question, document_ids? }
    API->>Auth: Validate JWT & User Status
    Auth-->>API: Authorized User Context
    API->>Emb: get_embedding(question)
    Emb-->>API: 384-dimensional query vector
    API->>DB: Cosine Distance Query with User Ownership Filter
    Note over API,DB: SELECT * FROM chunks JOIN docs ON ... WHERE doc.user_id = :uid ORDER BY embedding <=> query_vec
    DB-->>API: Top-K Authorized Excerpts + Similarity Scores
    API->>API: Construct Grounded Prompt with Injection Boundaries
    API->>LLM: Chat Completion Request (System Instructions + Context + Query)
    LLM-->>API: Synthesized Response with Citations [Source X]
    API->>DB: Persist User & Assistant Messages with Citations
    API-->>User: JSON Response { answer, citations: [ { title, page, snippet } ] }
